# VYRO

### Fast. Clean. On-chain.

VYRO is a lightweight command-line tool for inspecting and benchmarking
EVM-compatible JSON-RPC endpoints.

It gives developers a fast way to check:

- RPC availability
- Network Chain ID
- Current block height
- Gas price
- Node synchronization status
- RPC client version
- Request latency
- RPC reliability
- Benchmark performance

No API key.
No database.
No external dependencies.

## Requirements

Python 3.9+

## Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/vyro.git
cd vyro
python vyro.py --rpc https://ethereum-rpc.publicnode.com
python vyro.py --rpc https://ethereum-rpc.publicnode.com --benchmark 20
python vyro.py --version
